WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
But what if the fire is too big?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,800
The speed of blood transformation

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,280
will exceed the speed of freezing

4
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,720
Blood melts faster than it freezes

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:09,880
The ice shell on the inner wall cannot support the vault, it is fixed.

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,480
It turns out that there is such a thing

7
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,720
small fire house

8
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,680
Fire destroys house

9
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,960
I've written it down, it's okay.

10
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,080
It's going to burn like this tonight

11
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,200
You guys spread it out with straw and sleep on it?

12
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,560
Sleep, sleep here, sleep here

13
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,400
No matter how strong the wind and snow are outside, it won’t look for us

14
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,600
The fire and ice inside

15
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,560
It won't freeze us

16
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,480
Have a good sleep this night

17
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:43,580
village house
